,"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2001,"series":["al-52"],"seriesIds":[52],"startDate":{"day":1,"month":4,"year":2001},"status":"FINISHED","studios":[{"animation":true,"id":4,"name":"bones"},{"animation":false,"id":717,"name":"TV Tokyo Music"},{"animation":false,"id":376,"name":"Sentai Filmworks"}],"synopsis":{"language":null,"source":"anilist","spoiler":false,"text":"From the moment twelve-year-old Misaki Suzuhara first arrives in Tokyo to live with her aunt, she finds herself swept away by the amazing world of Angelic Layer – a fast-paced high-tech game where dolls called “Angels” are controlled by the thoughts of their operator, or “Deus”. Discovering that her new friends are as interested in Angelic Layer as she is, Misaki builds her own Angel, Hikaru, and begins competing in battles where will and determination count far more than size and strength. The competitions are going to be fierce and, with the national championships looming on the horizon, you can bet that not everyone Misaki meets will be on her side. Can Misaki handle the pressure of non-stop competition while struggling to adapt to life in an unfamiliar city?\n\n(Source: Sentai Filmworks)"},"tags":[{"name":"Robots","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Real Robot","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shounen","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Female Cast","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Proxy Battle","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Child Cast","rank":52,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Disability","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":20,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Estranged Family","rank":20,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Love Triangle","rank":20,"spoiler":true}],"titles":{"display":"Angelic Layer","english":"Angelic Layer","native":"機動天使エンジェリックレイヤー","romaji":"Kidou Tenshi Angelic Layer","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"天使领域"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"机动天使"}]},"trailer":nu